{"title":"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For the nonzero numbers a, b, and c, define\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/5/595bdbbce760b90450663fe2b57d9c64a37b20e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D(a,b,c)=\\frac{abc}{a+b+c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"167\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/1/c7193bf02055d47f419465cee5f22f83d2f552d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D(2,4,6)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/9/5b99e53d7245f78618fbfe4fb310c4be4652182b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 1\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 2\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 4\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } 6\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"351\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/7/cc764659aa4b35a87b27ec40e8fe840634941596.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2\\cdot 4\\cdot 6}{2+4+6}=\\frac{48}{12}=4\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ (C) \\ }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"220\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_DDM\">Video Solution by DDM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by DDM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/vFS0xGLs2OQ\">https://youtu.be/vFS0xGLs2OQ</a>\n</p><p>~piggydude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span cl